    },
    {
      "id": "la_lv2_dark",
      "speaker": "LinearAlgebra",
      "text": "（凑得很近）你今天和程设说话的时间，比和我多了 23 分钟。我数过。",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "你怎么知道……？",
          "next": "la_lv2_dark_creepy",
          "effects": [
            {"target": "darkness", "delta": 5},
            {"target": "stress", "delta": 5}
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "明天我多陪陪你",
          "next": "la_lv2_dark_appease",
          "effects": [
            {"target": "affinity.LinearAlgebra", "delta": 3},
            {"target": "darkness", "delta": 3}
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "你这样让我害怕",
          "next": "la_lv2_dark_reject",
          "effects": [
            {"target": "darkness", "delta": 8},
            {"target": "affinity.LinearAlgebra", "delta": -3}
